  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can shred the flesh of creatures you hit with your claws.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Rending Claws<sup>APG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You add your mythic rank or tier to the damage you deal when you rend a creature with your claws. If your target has damage reduction or hardness, you combine the damage from both of your claw attacks as well as your rending damage as if it were a single attack for the purpose of overcoming that damage reduction or hardness.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-n-z-feats#toc49\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
